# User uploads. Only the seed images that ship with the repository are tracked;
# anything uploaded at runtime must stay out of version control. This is what
# keeps a deploy that resets the working tree (`git clean -fd`, `git checkout
# -f`) from deleting uploaded files: git clean skips ignored paths, and a
# deleted file leaves its database row behind, so every download of it then
# answers 404 «فایل یافت نشد.» — the ticket-attachment bug. Add a new seed
# image deliberately with `git add -f`. For a disposable checkout, point the
# MEDIA_ROOT environment variable at a persistent path instead (see
# ZaminexB/config/settings.py).
ZaminexB/media/
